{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S07、S13等段的感受句仍然偏密，连续阅读容易顾不上音乐，部分音乐术语和比喻也会增加理解负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词建立了清楚的人物叙事主线，感受文字则通过缩小层级和按音乐节点出现，形成了主次分明的阅读节奏；相比之下，X右侧短词虽然容易扫到，却常常像一组并列标签，缺少情绪发生和变化的过程。更重要的是，Y把音乐中的具体声响、节奏、动作和身体反应与人物心理联系起来，又通过主题回返、变形和情绪转折建立前后呼应，因此既能理解人物为什么这样想，也能感受到细腻而连续的心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ac3c231f-8d45-46fc-b4df-831f336cc185", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T043952424715Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:40:41.823679+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "960a595da723ffa7ae5aebe9b8e1990ca798e74662388bf0c755927f68765aba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg